 *
 * This component provides syntax highlighting for code in the Minotaur editor.
 * It supports multiple languages and themes.
 *
 * Usage:
 * <SyntaxHighlighting Code="your code here" LanguageId="csharp" />
 *
 * Features:
 * - Language-aware syntax highlighting
 * - Light and dark theme support
 * - Customizable color schemes
 * - Line numbers
 * - Current line highlighting
 * - Matching bracket highlighting
 *
 * Dependencies:
 * - Minotaur.Core.Services.Editor.SyntaxHighlightingService
 * - Minotaur.Core.Models.Editor.SyntaxHighlightingModels
